# Vercel hosts ONLY the frontend (Vite PWA). The api/ folder is the Fastify
# backend deployed separately on Render — without this, Vercel auto-detects the
# root api/ directory as Serverless Functions and tries to compile every file
# there (without `prisma generate`), which floods the build with TS errors and
# can block the frontend deploy. Keep it out of the Vercel build entirely.
api
docs
reference
_shots
.tmp
*.tmp.*
